{"title":"List of server commands/role","sourceTitle":"List of server commands/role/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages noprint navigation-not-searchable\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages-label\">Other languages:</div><ul class=\"mw-pt-languages-list\"><li><a href=\"/List_of_server_commands/role\" class=\"mw-pt-languages-ui mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"List of server commands/role (100% translated)\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">English</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/List_of_server_commands/role/fr\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Liste des commandes serveur/role (100% translated)\" lang=\"fr\" dir=\"ltr\">français</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-pt-languages-selected mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\">português do Brasil</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/List_of_server_commands/role/ru\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Список серверных команд/role (100% translated)\" lang=\"ru\" dir=\"ltr\">русский</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/List_of_server_commands/role/zh\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"服务器命令/角色 (100% translated)\" lang=\"zh\" dir=\"ltr\">中文</a></li></ul></div>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<ul><li><code>/role [rolename] [roleproperty]</code><br /> Exiba ou modifique <code>[roleproperty]</code> na função <code>[rolename]</code>.\n<ul><li><code>/role [rolename] spawnpoint [x] [y?] [z]</code> <br />Configure um ponto de spawn específico da função. Qualquer jogador que tenha esta função irá aparecer neste local.</li>\n<li><code>/role [rolename] privilege [grant|revoke] [privelegename]</code><br />Conceder ou revogar privilégios de determinada função.</li>\n<li><code>/role [rolename] landclaimallowance [value]</code><br />Defina a área exigível máxima permitida em metros cúbicos para cada jogador que tem esta função. (padrão: 4 pedaços = 4*32*32*32 metros cúbicos = 131072)</li>\n<li><code>/role [rolename] landclaimmaxareas [value]</code><br /> Defina a quantidade máxima de áreas não adjacentes que um jogador pode reivindicar. (padrão: 3)</li>\n<li><code>/role [rolename] landclaimminsize [x y z]</code><br /> Defina o menor cuboide que um jogador pode reivindicar. (padrão: 6 por 6 por 6)</li></ul></li></ul>\n<p><br />\n<a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/List_of_server_commands\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/List of server commands\">Lista de comandos do servidor</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/List_of_server_commands\" title=\"List of server commands\"> </a></span>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261111120310\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.011 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.016 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 31/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 283/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 150/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1113/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.774      1 Template:Ll\n100.00%    0.774      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wikinew-vs_:pcache:idhash:170218-0!canonical and timestamp 20261111120310 and revision id 377255. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>","sections":[],"revid":377255,"sourceUrl":"https://wiki.vintagestory.at/index.php?title=List_of_server_commands%2Frole%2Fpt-br","capturedAt":"2026-11-11T12:03:11.031Z"}